  Role: Assigned Teacher - set bearerToken to seed-tch-a3 token
  Needs: organization_id=seed-org-a, created_class_id from 412 with 417 assignment (0 active profiles initially, or 1 synthetic profile if run after 317 before 340)
  Expected: 200 / Be1ManagedProfileListV1 (consent-filtered items, next_cursor string|null with default limit=25 max=100, active_profile_count >= items.length)
  Source: backend/src/sketch2life/interfaces/http/routers/be1_registry.py:902-1010, backend/src/sketch2life/interfaces/http/api_conventions.py:21-22,59-66
}

